{"id":"457241","name":"小白菜土豆排骨汤","author":"lengnina","authorId":"701321","desc":"","cover":"images/457241/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小白菜","amount":"一把"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"一个"},{"name":"排骨汤","amount":"一碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"一小勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小白菜切段以后焯水过凉水挤掉水备用，土豆切条，煮好的排骨汤，葱切碎。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/06/201905061557154961760701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅烧油，一点点油足够，爆香葱后放土豆条。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/06/201905061557155010545701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"土豆条炒透明放一勺生抽。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/06/201905061557155068478701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入排骨汤之后放一小勺盐。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/06/201905061557155099369701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮开后放入小白菜。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/06/201905061557155121922701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"再次煮开关火撒香菜，成品。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/06/201905061557155164979701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"排骨汤不需要太多调味品，够咸就很鲜美。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}